      "description": "pudl_diff compares two sets of PUDL Parquet outputs, local or remote, table\nby table: their schemas, row counts, and row contents (matched on primary\nkeys where a table has them). It writes a colorized terminal summary, a JSON\nreport described by a published JSON Schema, and Parquet files of the\ndiffering rows.",
      "dev_url": "https://github.com/catalyst-cooperative/pudl-diff",
      "doc_url": "https://docs.catalyst.coop/pudl-diff",
